- Event dates in the past.
- Impossible task deadlines.
- Conflicting task dependencies.
- Duplicate or missing identifiers.
- Malformed or incomplete AI responses.
- Gemini quota exhaustion or service unavailability.
- Network disconnection.
- Failed database writes.
